      "text": "The local MCP server exposes eight tools: onui_list_pages, onui_get_annotations, onui_get_report, onui_search_annotations, onui_update_annotation_metadata, onui_bulk_update_annotation_metadata, onui_delete_annotation, and onui_clear_page_annotations."
